[[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Undo the fixing bolts (1a) and remove the flange (1b) complete with oil seal.</p><p>Remove the scraper ring.</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002284.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>Replace the oil seal.</p><p>1. Remove the oil seal from the flange (a destructive operation) and, using the tools (1a) and (1b), fit the new oil seal.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1a</p></td><td><p>Grip</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.007.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.629.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002285.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[63,7,0,"<p>Fit the scraper ring.</p><p>Fit the flange, tightening the bolts to torque.</p>"],[16,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"removing\" data-part=\"removal\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"refitting\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</a><p>1. Remove the left internal differential driveshaft (1a) complete with circlip (1b).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002286.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,7,0,"<p>1. Undo the bolts (1a) and remove the left flange on the differential (1b), complete with oil seal (1c).</p><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002287.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,7,0,"<p>At the bench, release the oil seal from the flange (this operation destroys it).</p>"],[16,7,0,"<h3 class=\"step\" data-step=\"refitting\" data-part=\"refit\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/21.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Refitting</h3><a class=\"jump\" href=\"#\" data-jump=\"removing\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/20.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\">Removing</a><p>1. Fit a new oil seal (1a) on the left flange on the differential using the tools (1b) and (1c).</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1b</p></td><td><p>Grip</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.007.000</p></td></tr></table></div><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000695.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Name</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Country</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>Fitting tool</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>1.870.629.000</p></td></tr></table></div><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002288.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,7,0,"<p>1. Refit the left flange on the differential (1a), complete with oil seal (1b), and secure it tightening the bolts (1c) to the recommended torque.</p><div class=\"table\"><table><tr><th><figure class=\"diagram\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223000656.svg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure></th><th><p>Fastening</p></th><th><p>Component</p></th><th><p>Ø</p></th><th colspan=\"1\"><p>Value</p><p>(daNm)</p></th></tr><tr><td><p>1c</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td><p>-</p></td><td colspan=\"1\"><p>-</p></td></tr></table></div><aside class=\"note\"><img class=\"icon\" src=\"../media/767.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"><p>Before fitting the left flange on the differential, make sure that the scraper ring is present and correctly fitted on the differential.</p></aside><figure class=\"photo\"><img class=\"zoomable\" src=\"../media/223002289.jpg\" alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\"></figure>"],[16,7,0,"<p>Place the left differential internal driveshaft back in its housing complete with a new seal.</p>"]]